  _senarioDescription: 'The deafening screech rings in your brain, causing dizziness,
    fatigue, and eventually causing you to pass out. As you awake, you make your
    way downstairs to check for a body, but nothing remains. The door you had previously
    closed is now wide open, and footprints can be seen leading to the forest.  Leaving
    you wondering if it may return. ( Return to the woods - Ending) '
